window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-028-347f9df40c0b2ac8.json"]={sha256:"347f9df40c0b2ac8d40d353210a0993b005286227d76803ba7303068bac7ffec",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-8b4aa274f8cf8246","url":"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/configuration/security/secret","title":"Envoy Secret Discovery Service","titleEn":"Envoy Secret Discovery Service","publisher":"Envoy","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-028","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-028","related":[{"id":"security-v27-029","referenceUrls":["https://www.keycloak.org/docs/latest/authorization_services/index.html"],"title":"Keycloak UMA：資源範圍與決策策略交集","titleEn":"Keycloak UMA: resource scopes and decision-strategy intersections","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：140與70秒可重算，ACK單獨不足以通過驗收；新握手須呈現預期serial且保留bootstrap信任來源。 交付sds-rollout.csv、實例與listener關聯表及三種ACK/握手案例；不保存私鑰內容。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 140 and 70 seconds; ACK alone must not pass acceptance. A new handshake must present the expected serial, with bootstrap trust provenance retained. Deliver sds-rollout.csv, instance/listener associations and the three ACK/handshake cases. Record public fingerprints and identifiers only, never private-key contents.","difference":"建立12筆資源/scope請求，列出角色政策與資源所有權政策的各自結果；固定策略與資源伺服器，不將不同realm資料混算。","differenceEn":"Build 12 resource/scope requests with separate role-policy and resource-ownership outcomes. Pin decision strategy and resource server, avoiding the accidental aggregation of permissions from different realms or unrelated resource definitions.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課剩餘輪替時間從舊憑證到期減發布後傳播及採用延遲；ACK只能是中間證據，新連線觀察到的新serial才確認本課指定的採用結果。 舊憑證將於300秒到期，100秒發布，傳播40秒、採用20秒；全部以同一事件起點計時。 餘裕300−100−40−20=140秒；傳播延長至110秒時剩70秒。","本課指定兩政策皆正面才授權；計數必須取逐列交集，不能把兩政策各自允許數相加。實際部署還需核對permission層與聚合policy各自策略。 12筆中角色政策通過9筆，所有權通過8筆，兩者共同通過6筆；資料表明列共同與單側通過者。 Unanimous通過率6/12×100=50%；補正兩筆已有角色資格者的所有權資料後，交集變8，比例66.667%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The rotation margin subtracts propagation and adoption delays from old-certificate expiry. ACK is intermediate evidence; the selected acceptance test requires a new connection to observe the replacement serial, rather than relying on a control-plane event alone. The old certificate expires at second 300. Publish at 100, allow 40 seconds for propagation and 20 for adoption, all measured from one event origin. Existing long-lived connections are outside this new-handshake timing model. Margin is 300−100−40−20=140 seconds. Extending propagation to 110 seconds leaves 70. This does not claim that every existing session renegotiates when a new secret arrives.","The exercise requires both policies to evaluate positively. Count the row-level intersection rather than adding independent allow totals. A deployment must also verify strategy settings at the permission and aggregated-policy levels, which are distinct configuration locations. Among 12 requests the role policy passes nine, ownership passes eight and six pass both. List joint and one-sided outcomes explicitly so the intersection is inspectable and not inferred from marginal totals alone. Unanimous admission is 6/12×100=50 percent. Correcting ownership for two already role-qualified requests increases the intersection to eight, or approximately 66.667 percent, without changing the request population.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-038","referenceUrls":["https://github.com/openvex/spec/blob/main/OPENVEX-SPEC.md"],"title":"OpenVEX：產品、子元件與不受影響聲明的適用範圍","titleEn":"OpenVEX: product scope, subcomponents and not-affected claims","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：140與70秒可重算，ACK單獨不足以通過驗收；新握手須呈現預期serial且保留bootstrap信任來源。 交付sds-rollout.csv、實例與listener關聯表及三種ACK/握手案例；不保存私鑰內容。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 140 and 70 seconds; ACK alone must not pass acceptance. A new handshake must present the expected serial, with bootstrap trust provenance retained. Deliver sds-rollout.csv, instance/listener associations and the three ACK/handshake cases. Record public fingerprints and identifiers only, never private-key contents.","difference":"建立12筆產品/元件/漏洞配對，保存purl、版本、摘要、聲明作者及理由；本地假漏洞ID不可與真實已知漏洞結論混用。","differenceEn":"Build 12 product/component/vulnerability tuples with purl, version, digest, statement author and rationale. Use clearly fictional vulnerability identifiers so classroom assertions cannot be mistaken for vulnerability advice about a real released product.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課剩餘輪替時間從舊憑證到期減發布後傳播及採用延遲；ACK只能是中間證據，新連線觀察到的新serial才確認本課指定的採用結果。 舊憑證將於300秒到期，100秒發布，傳播40秒、採用20秒；全部以同一事件起點計時。 餘裕300−100−40−20=140秒；傳播延長至110秒時剩70秒。","本地接受規則要求產品與子元件識別都符合、作者受信任且理由可查；格式有效只是輸入門檻，不等於not_affected內容已被獨立證實。 12筆發現中7筆有精確適用且理由已審查的聲明，3筆版本不符，2筆缺理由；三類互斥。 可採用聲明率7/12×100≈58.333%；補齊一筆原缺理由且識別符合者後為8/12×100≈66.667%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["The rotation margin subtracts propagation and adoption delays from old-certificate expiry. ACK is intermediate evidence; the selected acceptance test requires a new connection to observe the replacement serial, rather than relying on a control-plane event alone. The old certificate expires at second 300. Publish at 100, allow 40 seconds for propagation and 20 for adoption, all measured from one event origin. Existing long-lived connections are outside this new-handshake timing model. Margin is 300−100−40−20=140 seconds. Extending propagation to 110 seconds leaves 70. This does not claim that every existing session renegotiates when a new secret arrives.","Local acceptance requires matching product and subcomponent identities, a trusted author and reviewable rationale. Structural validity is only an input gate, not independent confirmation that a not_affected assertion is technically correct. Seven of 12 findings have exactly applicable statements with reviewed rationale, three have version mismatches and two lack adequate rationale. Make these categories disjoint so a single deficient statement is not subtracted twice. Usable statement coverage is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Completing rationale for one identity-matching case raises it to 8/12×100, approximately 66.667 percent, while version mismatches remain inapplicable.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-bd763f41f0267698","url":"https://www.keycloak.org/docs/latest/authorization_services/index.html","title":"Keycloak Authorization Services Guide","titleEn":"Keycloak Authorization Services Guide","publisher":"Keycloak","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-5793a45355e67a8c","url":"https://github.com/openvex/spec/blob/main/OPENVEX-SPEC.md","title":"OpenVEX specification","titleEn":"OpenVEX specification","publisher":"OpenVEX","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
